CSS aspect-ratio for non-replaced boxes: the preferred ratio sizes an auto axis from the
definite one through the box-sizing box, exactly for scroll containers or under an authored
minimum, otherwise above the automatic minimum the content sets (CSS Box Sizing 4 §5).
Flex columns transfer a definite or stretched width (CSS Flexbox 9.2.3); the forms layout
does not represent refuse at layout.

